I.B. Baseline - Purpose Statement
Describe, at a high level, what activities will be implemented and what will be 
accomplished by this Investment (1,000 Char. Max) 




I.C Baseline - Description 
Provide a summary description of the current state of this Investment, its 
objectives, and any outcomes that will be completed prior to the application of 
FY08 HSGP funds. Include in this description whether this is a new Investment or 
an Investment in maintenance/sustainment. Describe the capability gap(s) that 
this Investment is intended to address. (2,500 Char. Max)




